{
  "description": "applyOps (ARCHITECTURE §5.1): visible = applyOps(synced, actions, applyContextFor(provider, exclusiveLabelIds)). `effect` is diffKeys(sortDedupe(synced), visible.keys) (ops.effect, undo). `inverses`: undo vectors (§5.2, D-250); `effect` is the diff one `action` causes from sortDedupe(synced), `inverse` is inverseAction(action, effect, provider !== \"gmail\") (null = nothing to undo, mode \"noop\"), and `restored` is applyOps(synced, [action, inverse]) (or the state after `action` when `inverse` is null). Run by packages/mail-model (test/fixtures.test.ts) and crates/core::model::apply_ops.",
